<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were steady. Demand and movement light to moderate. Top $59.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>				Country			     Plant</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 LBS.  57.00-58.50, Few 56.50	 58.00-59.50</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 LBS.  52.00-57.00</p>
<p>	  210-230 LBS.  47.00-52.00</p>
<p>Sows: Steady in a light test. Top 48.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-400 LBS.  41.50-42.50</p>
<p>	  400-500 lbs.  43.00-45.00, few 42.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 LBS.  46.00-47.00, few 44.50</p>
<p>Few over 600 LBS.  47.00-48.00</p>
</text>
